{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏を感じる今日この頃"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セミを見つけたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔はよく帽子をかぶって網をもって虫を入れる箱をもって、おばぁちゃんととりにいってたなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしておうちで逃がしてワイワイ遊んでた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんとはドジョウをとりにいったことがあるよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、今日のタイトルは皆さんが考えてくださったのでわなく、\nコメントに書いてあった文をタイトルにしてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてくださった方申し訳ありません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後きおつけます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね！まあやのことミラクルガールって書いてあったんだもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃぁ意味はよくわかんないけど、かわいいんだもん〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにもいいこといってくれた方いたよ〜ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開ラジオ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は東京タワーにて公開ラジオがあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな、ロッティ〜ちゃんとせいらりんです♪\nいつも優しくしてくれる優しいお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝からものすごく楽しみです\nお陰ではやく起きてしまったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキ...\nまぁいいことだ\n『早起きはさんもんのとく』\nっというしね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで、今は満員電車に揺れています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとすっこしっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっとすっこしっ♪\nあとすっこしぃーで、\n皆にあっえぇーるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルンルン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ終了後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁー待ちに待ったラジオがついに終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー楽しかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかあんなに近くに皆さんがいるなんて........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇーお恥ずかしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとドキドキしてしまった\n...ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は盛り上がっていただけましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやさんは盛り上がりすぎて何をいったかあまりおぼえてまへん......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかてか、一番恥ずかしかったのがレーザーラモンHGさんの物真似を全力でしたことです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対ラジオじゃぁ伝わらないですよねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレヨンしんちゃんのものまねとか........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ今年一番恥ずかしいめに会いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく次回のラジオが楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん反省点もありますが、よかった点も合ったので、次にいかせたらと思います！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも皆様と、今日一緒にしてくれたロッティ〜ちゃんとせいらりんのおかげです...キャー照れるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、ほんで、ラジオがおわったら\n『"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nしましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、皆さんが来ないから先食べてそのままレッスンにむかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人ともお腹ペコペコリンだったから\n『.........。』\nってかんじでひたすら食べました\n最後らへんは、\n『無言だねー』\nとか、\n今日のラジオについて話したりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオまだ聞いてないひといたら聞いてねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいたかなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いたら感想のコメまってるぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてblogのコメもまってるぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※読み逃げ禁止だじょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では最後は皆さん一緒に〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Y"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"E"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}